{"challenge_uid":"69338303-93a2-4121-bca1-ed115e6f591b","challenge_id":4,"challenge_name":"Xmen","unit":51,"difficulty_levels":["easy","moderate","hard"],"total_steps":3,"steps":[{"difficulty":"easy","step_id":1,"description":"<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">The </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Xavier Institute For Higher Learning</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> is Professor X's school for the mutants. Working there as a secretary, you wanted to upgrade its record system with a Python prorgam, since your coding skill is comparable to their superpowers.\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">You decided that you will need to create records for human staff like yourself, as well as, for mutant staff and students. Hence, you will start by creating a </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Human </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">class with variables </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">and </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">gender. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Since, mutants are similar in many ways to human, you just need to create another </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Mutant </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">class that inherits </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Human </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">with the following attributes:\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">    Class Variable\n        </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">count\n                  </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">stores the number of mutants created\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">    Object Variable\n        </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">superpower\n                </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> stores the superpower\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">    Function\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">        record()\n  </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">               append all values onto file </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\"data.txt\"</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> \n                 in the format \"</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">gender</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">superpower</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\"\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">    Static Functions\n       </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">display(mutant_list)</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">                 display the information of all the mutant objects in</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> \n                 mutant_list</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> in the format \"</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">gender</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">superpower</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\"\n                 followed by the </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">count</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">         main()\n<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">                 main() performs the following:\n                 1. Asks the user to enter the name, gender and superpower of a mutant.\n                 2. Create a </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Mutant </span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">object and call </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">record()</span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> to save its values to a file.\n                 3. Append the object to a list named </span><span style=\"font-style: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">mutant_list</span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">.\n                 4. If the user enters \"end\" for the name, the program will display the contents \n                     of </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">mutant_list </span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">and terminate. Otherwise, repeat step (1) to (3).\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Run </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Mutant.main()</span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">.\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Follow the test output display format and comment your codes.</span></span></p><div><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Test Input</span></u><br></div><p><span style=\"col